        "original_id": "479a2360-2bc4-507c-9533-09e7ee74bdc7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Angostura bitters, Springbokkie\n- Companies: House of Angostura\n- Places: Trinidad and Tobago, South Africa\n- Concepts: bitters, cocktail shooters, ingredients\n\nFacts:\n- Angostura bitters is a concentrated bitters made of water, 44.7% ethanol, gentian, herbs, and spices.\n- House of Angostura makes Angostura bitters in Trinidad and Tobago.\n- The Springbokkie means \"little Springbok\" in Afrikaans.\n- The Springbokkie is a cocktail shooter made with creme de menthe or substitutes and Amarula.\n- The Springbokkie is popular in South Africa.",
